units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
newton on
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 66 0 66 0 213 units box
create_box 1 whole
region target block 0 66 0 66 0 132 units box
region proj block 0 66 0 66 147 213 units box
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region proj
group target region target
group projectile region proj
group all union target projectile
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
mass 1 92.90638
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix nvt all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix nvt
velocity projectile add 0 0 -20 sum yes
fix nve all nve
run 200000
